# The CLI upload walks the working tree and the raw mass-run artifacts blow
# past the 15000-file API limit (25k benchmark scans + 26k dev scan records);
# none of these are read by the deployed app (Redis backend + Supabase).
# Root-anchored on purpose: a bare "db/" would also match src/lib/db/ and
# break the module resolution in the build container.
.git
.vercel
/db/
/scripts/benchmark_data/
/scripts/__pycache__/
/lighthouse-results/
/docs/
/tests/
*.log
*.pid
